WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.510
A bill walks into Parliament.

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.840
What must happen before it walks

3
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.290
out as an Act?

4
00:00:07.685 --> 00:00:11.425
Step one, introduction.

5
00:00:11.425 --> 00:00:13.425
A bill may begin in either

6
00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:16.845
House. A Money Bill, only in the

7
00:00:16.845 --> 00:00:18.021
Lok Sabha.

8
00:00:19.481 --> 00:00:22.361
Step two, the committee.

9
00:00:22.361 --> 00:00:24.681
It studies the bill and reports

10
00:00:24.681 --> 00:00:27.221
back. The government need not

11
00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:29.071
accept every suggestion.

12
00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:32.479
Step three, the second reading.

13
00:00:32.479 --> 00:00:35.359
Each clause may be accepted,

14
00:00:35.359 --> 00:00:37.569
amended or rejected.

15
00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:41.551
Step four, the third reading.

16
00:00:41.551 --> 00:00:43.731
The House votes on the final

17
00:00:43.731 --> 00:00:44.661
text.

18
00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:47.387
Step five, the other House.

19
00:00:47.387 --> 00:00:48.827
Same readings;

20
00:00:48.827 --> 00:00:50.427
both must agree.

21
00:00:50.427 --> 00:00:53.587
On a Money Bill, the Rajya Sabha

22
00:00:53.587 --> 00:00:55.647
gets fourteen days to recommend,

23
00:00:55.647 --> 00:00:58.367
which the Lok Sabha may politely

24
00:00:58.367 --> 00:00:59.197
decline.

25
00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:03.106
Step six, if the Houses are

26
00:01:03.106 --> 00:01:05.506
stuck: a joint sitting.

27
00:01:05.506 --> 00:01:07.986
A majority present and voting

28
00:01:07.986 --> 00:01:08.876
decides.

29
00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.300
Step seven, assent.

30
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.820
The President signs, or returns

31
00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:17.380
an ordinary bill once.

32
00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:20.500
If it passes again, assent

33
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.010
cannot be withheld.

34
00:01:23.113 --> 00:01:23.900
For GS2:

35
00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.813
three readings, both Houses,

36
00:01:25.813 --> 00:01:27.313
then assent.

37
00:01:27.313 --> 00:01:29.673
Articles one hundred seven to

38
00:01:29.673 --> 00:01:31.067
one hundred eleven.

39
00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.020
Three readings.

40
00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.990
Two Houses.

41
00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.150
One signature.
